      <data key="d2">cb-0330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CELLULAR BEHAVIOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cellular Behavior is the outcome studied in mechanobiology that Pruitt discussed in her lecture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cellular Behavior is the subject of Beth L. Pruitt's lecture 'Mechanobiology of Cell Adhesion and Migration', exploring the intricate relationships between mechanical forces and cellular behavior."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MECHANICAL FORCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mechanical Forces are a key component of mechanobiology that Pruitt explored in her lecture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mechanical Forces are the subject of Beth L. Pruitt's lecture 'Mechanobiology of Cell Adhesion and Migration', exploring their relationship with cellular behavior."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CELL ADHESION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cell Adhesion is a specific aspect of mechanobiology that Pruitt discussed in her lecture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cell Adhesion is the subject of Beth L. Pruitt's lecture 'Mechanobiology of Cell Adhesion and Migration', exploring its relationship with cellular migration."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CELLULAR MIGRATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cellular Migration is the subject of Beth L. Pruitt's lecture 'Mechanobiology of Cell Adhesion and Migration', exploring its relationship with cell adhesion."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MECHANICAL PROPERTIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mechanical Properties are the subject of Beth L. Pruitt's research and publications, including her paper 'Mechanical Properties of Cells and Tissues: A Review'."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRUITT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pruitt is a researcher known for her work in mechanobiology and her contributions to the intersection of engineering and biology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0330</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WATSON SCHOOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
