    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MECHANOBIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mechanobiology is the field of study that Pruitt specializes in, focusing on the relationships between mechanical forces and cellular behavior."</data>
